  "info": {
    "name": "GVP Spring Boot Unit4 - Book Store API (Baseline, no security)",
    "description": "Baseline collection for the GVP Book Store API teaching project.\n\nThis is the STARTING POINT before any security is added: plain CRUD for Books and Categories, no login, no tokens, every endpoint open. As you work through docs/unit4-guide.html step by step (Password Encoding -> JWT -> RBAC -> OAuth2 -> Testing -> Deployment), you'll add Auth/OAuth2 requests back into a collection like this yourself, matching the curl commands given at each step.\n\nBase URL defaults to http://localhost:8081 (server.port). No database - data is seeded fresh on every restart (2 categories, 3 books).",
